{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-18","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与比例与整数","englishTitle":"Between two similar plane numbers there is one mean proportional number; and the plane number has to the plane number the ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side.","book":8,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","contentId":"euclid-8-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90e8d5030389b97aa3f0ac3e5e7cd35420d2f1727abf2c9aa3535022cfaa82b1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-18.statement","euclid-8-18.construction.1","euclid-8-18.proof.1","euclid-8-18.proof.2","euclid-8-18.proof.3","euclid-8-18.proof.4","euclid-8-18.proof.5","euclid-8-18.proof.6","euclid-8-18.proof.7","euclid-8-18.proof.8","euclid-8-18.proof.9","euclid-8-18.proof.10","euclid-8-18.proof.11","euclid-8-18.proof.12","euclid-8-18.proof.13","euclid-8-18.proof.14","euclid-8-18.proof.15","euclid-8-18.conclusion","euclid-8-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"032458d26d2bc25ca3a104a7591e6de029269321e062b53ab10c923da6ea0071","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Between two similar plane numbers there is one mean proportional number; and the plane number has to the plane number the ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两个相似平面数之间,有一个比例中项个数字;平面数个数字与平面数个数字的比相同,而对应方与对应方的比相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c27a3f88dddef948f7e1f8d9847452f15c28b5abb88694f26f8ec4f5d3958d94","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two similar plane numbers, and let the numbers C, D be the sides of A, and E, F of B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是2 相似平面数, 让C,D是A的两边, B的E,F是B的两边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa36d2f5cec35e1dbea9ab0f58d96abc4764733a742ba612de0a46b7f9afeb65","citations":["euclid-7-def-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since similar plane numbers are those which have their sides proportional, [[VII. Def. 21](/principles/euclid-7-def-21)] therefore, as C is to D, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,相似平面数是那些有其侧面成比例的人,因此,C对D的比等于E对F的比；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。 [[VII. Def. 21](/principles/euclid-7-def-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7cb272c8e0a3fa8f35170788c467bf099611dbd9bbe2619149cc29fef8bc6881","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say then that between A, B there is one mean proportional number, and A has to B the ratio duplicate of that which C has to E, or D to F, that is, of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我当时说,A至B间,有1 比例中项个数字,A数字与C数字(C数字为E数字)或D至F数字(即对应方对相应方的比)重复B数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"572fde8ea9ce01e569c9c0ecc3435be07ddcfd6b040fd135fc3375350ea16760","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as C is to D, so is E to F, therefore, alternately, as C is to E, so is D to F. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C对D的比等于E对F的比,因此,C对E的比等于D对F的比；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；C 与 E 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a2c9bd36b53c16711397851afe88f2967c6e09cc1c16bafcd2e95ee7c28adfb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A is plane, and C, D are its sides, therefore D by multiplying C has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是平面,C,D是它的侧面, 因此D乘以C 已经达到A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ea2dbd19ace44f8f23d94a6784c327003a5ee5e94d3fb3eb6b6da0b0fbcf69e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also E by multiplying F has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,E乘以F, 已经做了B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad5cf1ce377ebeb076637e7db6df1896dfcc18e5f9ef3fce8fb200a456600bfb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let D by multiplying E make G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,D和E的产物是G。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fea76f273ce16f12f43f40bc492e8d32b8e7013637bb01f9288b58b649ceb989","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since D by multiplying C has made A, and by multiplying E has made G, therefore, as C is to E, so is A to G. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D乘以C, A, E乘以G, C比E, C比A比G；C 与 E 之比等于 A 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80d881bdcb1ee1df189ee09400e8d3c6297152cc32470deb55e17e1ff1d69a64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to E, so is D to F; therefore also, as D is to F, so is A to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C对E的比等于D对F的比;因此,D对F的比等于A对G的比；C 与 E 之比等于 D 与 F 之比；D 与 F 之比等于 A 与 G 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e39f262041bb081207dadaea00ef4016631fe9ddc35187d2dfefedfdb1718b7b","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since E by multiplying D has made G, and by multiplying F has made B, therefore, as D is to F, so is G to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自E乘以D后,G成为G,F成为B,因此,D与F的比等于G与B的比；D 与 F 之比等于 G 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"decf9b1551f15ff1a35c36a1b6dffd9e5f808adf56d788936899ce2aba0f6434","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as D is to F, so is A to G; therefore also, as A is to G, so is G to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,D对F的比等于A对G的比;因此,A对G的比等于G对B的比；D 与 F 之比等于 A 与 G 之比；A 与 G 之比等于 G 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b99c77b5ebb870cea4a12dff5727451f0b07cc59e46e4b2d1dc3c501b60fff22","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, G, B are in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,G,B是连比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6fa0b6cf4a6b9b1643d1865954a1e1df99c395ef098d1b812aecc399b9fe26ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore between A, B there is one mean proportional number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B之间 有一个比例中项的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae5aa4b77e36d25421a4729d9bf5669b36c1758946595ca5563ef39275620e23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that A also has to B the ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side, that is, of that which C has to E or D to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,A的比例也与相应方的比例(即C的比例为E或D,即F的比例)重复到B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a24c1da4129eea299ffb397df48a210b44d2f8c430d55171ca89b8438211d628","citations":["euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, G, B are in continued proportion, A has to B the ratio duplicate of that which it has to G. [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于A,G,B是连比例,A比B的比重复到G。 [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fee7442773e9c1ab44f762c80d54309ff90f7899b806f8061acd931eb35523c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as A is to G, so is C to E, and so is D to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比G等于C比E,D比F；A 与 G 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"759b39480e752ac6be18b93e9ecc62d0267414296b1aa81654b10939474416e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A also has to B the ratio duplicate of that which C has to E or D to F. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A的比例也与C的比例(E)重复,即D与F重复。（相关点与线段：B）"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-18.source","contentId":"euclid-8-18","revisionId":"euclid-8-18@raw-90e8d5030389b97a","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1bfbfd2faa71d832a230ba11ce20d29a3720f4de8805ff29be8b5a49ad0890d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-18:euclid-7-def-21:explicit","sourceContent